  "overview": "My research is focused on determining the causal genes and underlying mechanisms responsible for the initiation and propagation of smooth muscle cell driven vascular dysregulation that occurs in cardiovascular disease (CVD) pathologies including atherosclerosis, peripheral artery disease (PAD), and abdominal aortic aneurysm. To this end, my lab uses state-of-the-art techniques in molecular biology, human genetics, bioinformatics, and established mouse models of CVD.",
